  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 499,
      "start_index": 1,
      "end_index": 17,
      "text": "===== 资讯助理 =====",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 500,
      "start_index": 19,
      "end_index": 52,
      "text": "🌤 大家早上好，欢迎回到 ELLERY WESTCOTT 社群！",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 501,
      "start_index": 54,
      "end_index": 92,
      "text": "昨晚先生讲到，面对市场变化，不能只寻找支持自己判断的信息，也要认真考虑风险。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 502,
      "start_index": 94,
      "end_index": 156,
      "text": "今天我们就从昨夜美股的实际收盘情况开始，看看市场出现了哪些新变化，以及这些变化对欧洲和罗马尼亚市场有哪些值得关注的地方。☀️",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 503,
      "start_index": 158,
      "end_index": 162,
      "text": "21女：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 504,
      "start_index": 164,
      "end_index": 178,
      "text": "早上好！昨晚有什么大事件吗？",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 505,
      "start_index": 180,
      "end_index": 196,
      "text": "===== 资讯助理 =====",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 506,
      "start_index": 198,
      "end_index": 208,
      "text": "先来看美国收盘数据：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 507,
      "start_index": 210,
      "end_index": 241,
      "text": "道琼斯工业平均指数收于 52,177.69点，上涨1.08%；",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 508,
      "start_index": 242,
      "end_index": 270,
      "text": "标普500指数收于 7,744.06点，上涨0.33%；",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 509,
      "start_index": 271,
      "end_index": 301,
      "text": "纳斯达克综合指数收于 26,713.03点，上涨0.08%。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 510,
      "start_index": 303,
      "end_index": 362,
      "text": "三大指数最终全部收涨，但涨幅差异明显。道琼斯表现更强，纳斯达克仅小幅上涨，说明市场整体回升的同时，科技板块仍面临压力。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 511,
      "start_index": 364,
      "end_index": 405,
      "text": "这与前一天科技股明显承压的局面有所不同，但还不能简单理解为科技股已经全面恢复强势。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 512,
      "start_index": 406,
      "end_index": 410,
      "text": "18男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 513,
      "start_index": 412,
      "end_index": 435,
      "text": "昨天还在讨论科技股承压，今天三个指数就都涨了。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 514,
      "start_index": 436,
      "end_index": 440,
      "text": "05男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 515,
      "start_index": 441,
      "end_index": 485,
      "text": "到底是哪些行业把指数带起来的。如果主要靠其他板块上涨，那和科技股真正恢复强势还是两回事。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 516,
      "start_index": 486,
      "end_index": 502,
      "text": "===== 资讯助理 =====",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 517,
      "start_index": 504,
      "end_index": 523,
      "text": "再来看罗马尼亚本地市场的一条重要消息。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 518,
      "start_index": 524,
      "end_index": 562,
      "text": "根据报道，罗马尼亚新政府组建取得进展，市场对政治局势趋于稳定的预期有所增强。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 519,
      "start_index": 563,
      "end_index": 657,
      "text": "昨天布加勒斯特交易所BET指数上涨约2%，能源板块表现突出，其中Nuclearelectrica、OMV Petrom、Transgaz及Hidroelectrica等股票涨幅均超过3%。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 520,
      "start_index": 658,
      "end_index": 702,
      "text": "今天值得关注的是，组阁进展能否继续改善投资者信心，以及昨天表现较强的能源股能否维持活跃。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 521,
      "start_index": 703,
      "end_index": 707,
      "text": "18男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 522,
      "start_index": 708,
      "end_index": 732,
      "text": "昨天BET涨了这么多，原来不只是国际市场的影响。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 523,
      "start_index": 733,
      "end_index": 737,
      "text": "09男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 524,
      "start_index": 738,
      "end_index": 770,
      "text": "昨天几个主要能源公司都涨得不错，Ana，今天会给一些方向吗？🤔",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 525,
      "start_index": 771,
      "end_index": 775,
      "text": "02女：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 526,
      "start_index": 776,
      "end_index": 807,
      "text": "昨天已经涨了3%以上的股票，现在再追进去，会不会有点太晚了？ ",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 527,
      "start_index": 808,
      "end_index": 812,
      "text": "12男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 528,
      "start_index": 813,
      "end_index": 827,
      "text": "别太着急，先看看市场怎么走。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 529,
      "start_index": 828,
      "end_index": 832,
      "text": "21女：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 530,
      "start_index": 833,
      "end_index": 863,
      "text": "能源股那波行情还挺热闹的，今天估计又有不少人盯着这几只股票。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 531,
      "start_index": 867,
      "end_index": 871,
      "text": "09男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 532,
      "start_index": 872,
      "end_index": 930,
      "text": "18号，刚才你不是说想看看今天市场怎么走吗？现在终于开盘了。我先看看昨天比较活跃的能源股，今天还有没有那么热闹。😄",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 533,
      "start_index": 931,
      "end_index": 935,
      "text": "18男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 534,
      "start_index": 936,
      "end_index": 983,
      "text": "哈哈，你还真是盯着能源板块不放。我倒想看看其他股票有没有动静，不能每天打开行情都是那几家公司。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 535,
      "start_index": 984,
      "end_index": 988,
      "text": "05男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 536,
      "start_index": 989,
      "end_index": 1050,
      "text": "我也是。昨天政治方面的消息让市场挺活跃的，今天想看看这种情绪有没有延续。尤其是BET指数里的大公司，表现应该比较有代表性。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 537,
      "start_index": 1051,
      "end_index": 1055,
      "text": "19男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 538,
      "start_index": 1057,
      "end_index": 1072,
      "text": "今天的开盘信息怎么还没发布呢？",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 539,
      "start_index": 1073,
      "end_index": 1089,
      "text": "===== 资讯助理 =====",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 540,
      "start_index": 1090,
      "end_index": 1128,
      "text": "各位，布加勒斯特证券交易所今天已经进入交易时段，我们先来看看上午的市场表现。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 541,
      "start_index": 1129,
      "end_index": 1164,
      "text": "BET指数报34,886.11点，上涨393.88点，涨幅1.14%。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 542,
      "start_index": 1165,
      "end_index": 1173,
      "text": "从主要股票来看：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 543,
      "start_index": 1174,
      "end_index": 1197,
      "text": "📈 BRD：31.80 RON，+2.25%",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 544,
      "start_index": 1198,
      "end_index": 1233,
      "text": "📈 OMV Petrom（SNP）：1.327 RON，+1.69%",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 545,
      "start_index": 1234,
      "end_index": 1267,
      "text": "📈 Electrica（EL）：51.50 RON，+1.58%",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 546,
      "start_index": 1268,
      "end_index": 1299,
      "text": "📈 Romgaz（SNG）：19.18 RON，+1.48%",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 547,
      "start_index": 1300,
      "end_index": 1343,
      "text": "📈 Banca Transilvania（TLV）：35.76 RON，+0.90%",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 548,
      "start_index": 1344,
      "end_index": 1385,
      "text": "📈 Nuclearelectrica（SNN）：60.00 RON，+0.84%",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 549,
      "start_index": 1386,
      "end_index": 1426,
      "text": "📈 Hidroelectrica（H2O）：183.00 RON，+0.44%",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 550,
      "start_index": 1427,
      "end_index": 1476,
      "text": "从这组开盘后的数据来看，罗马尼亚市场整体表现积极，银行、能源及公用事业相关股票都有不同程度的上涨。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 551,
      "start_index": 1477,
      "end_index": 1514,
      "text": "今天也是本周最后一个交易日，上午的市场表现为本周交易增添了一个不错的开局。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 552,
      "start_index": 1515,
      "end_index": 1519,
      "text": "01男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 553,
      "start_index": 1520,
      "end_index": 1539,
      "text": "今天延时很久，我刚刚也没查到信息。😂",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 554,
      "start_index": 1540,
      "end_index": 1544,
      "text": "18男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 555,
      "start_index": 1545,
      "end_index": 1581,
      "text": "今天选的是FOJE啊，这家公司我之前还真没怎么关注过，名字倒是挺特别的。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 556,
      "start_index": 1582,
      "end_index": 1586,
      "text": "05男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 557,
      "start_index": 1587,
      "end_index": 1626,
      "text": "我刚查了一下，是做工业钻探服务的。平时看银行和能源股比较多，这类公司接触得少。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 558,
      "start_index": 1627,
      "end_index": 1631,
      "text": "12男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 559,
      "start_index": 1632,
      "end_index": 1672,
      "text": "我第一眼看到还以为是石油公司的代码。罗马尼亚市场确实还有不少我不熟悉的企业。😂",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 560,
      "start_index": 1673,
      "end_index": 1677,
      "text": "25男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 561,
      "start_index": 1678,
      "end_index": 1724,
      "text": "我之前买过FOJE，现在手里还持有一些。今天看到又选中了这只股票，有点心动。今天继续加仓吗？",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 562,
      "start_index": 1725,
      "end_index": 1728,
      "text": "03：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 563,
      "start_index": 1729,
      "end_index": 1759,
      "text": "我刚才还以为你准备第一次买呢，没想到你已经是老持有人了。😄",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 564,
      "start_index": 1760,
      "end_index": 1764,
      "text": "07女：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 565,
      "start_index": 1765,
      "end_index": 1778,
      "text": "先少量买入一点，了解一下！",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 566,
      "start_index": 1779,
      "end_index": 1783,
      "text": "05男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 567,
      "start_index": 1784,
      "end_index": 1828,
      "text": "原来你已经持有了啊。那你之前的买入价是多少？如果已经有仓位，再买和第一次买还是有区别的。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 568,
      "start_index": 1829,
      "end_index": 1833,
      "text": "25男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 569,
      "start_index": 1834,
      "end_index": 1920,
      "text": "我上周在32.3 RON附近买的，后来涨到33左右卖掉了一部分，今天看到已经涨到34.4了，确实有点后悔之前卖早了。😂 现在再加仓的话，成本就抬高了不少，所以还挺纠结的。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 570,
      "start_index": 1921,
      "end_index": 1925,
      "text": "38男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 571,
      "start_index": 1926,
      "end_index": 1984,
      "text": "我也买进了一些，说实话，心里还是有些犹豫。不过之前已经跟过好几次推荐了，也不想再错过这次机会，整体来说还是有信心的。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 572,
      "start_index": 1985,
      "end_index": 1989,
      "text": "13男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 573,
      "start_index": 1990,
      "end_index": 2036,
      "text": "能看得出来，你们之前跟着推荐应该是有一定盈利的，不然也不会在现在这个相对高位还愿意继续买入。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 574,
      "start_index": 2037,
      "end_index": 2041,
      "text": "13男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 575,
      "start_index": 2042,
      "end_index": 2090,
      "text": "能看得出来，你们之前跟着推荐应该是有一定盈利的，不然也不会在现在这个相对高位还愿意继续买入。😄",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 576,
      "start_index": 2091,
      "end_index": 2110,
      "text": "25男：\u000b哈哈，之前那笔确实赚到了一点",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 577,
      "start_index": 2111,
      "end_index": 2115,
      "text": "40男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 578,
      "start_index": 2116,
      "end_index": 2144,
      "text": "上午忙着处理工作，刚刚才有时间看看欧洲市场。还好赶上了。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 579,
      "start_index": 2145,
      "end_index": 2161,
      "text": "===== 资讯助理 =====",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 580,
      "start_index": 2162,
      "end_index": 2211,
      "text": "刚才看到大家讨论FOJE时，发现一个的现象：即使关注的是同一家公司，有人已经持有，有人刚开始了解。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 581,
      "start_index": 2212,
      "end_index": 2258,
      "text": "这让我想起Jonathan先生昨晚讲到的投资纪律。我们做决定时，往往不只是受到价格影响，也会",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 582,
      "start_index": 2259,
      "end_index": 2330,
      "text": "今天上午就先不展开新的股票研究了。大家不妨想想，自己有没有过这样的经历：明明已经作出了决定，后来看到价格变化，又开始怀疑当初是不是选错了。😊",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 583,
      "start_index": 2331,
      "end_index": 2335,
      "text": "25男：",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 584,
      "start_index": 2336,
      "end_index": 2389,
      "text": "这个我确实深有体会。之前还没收到卖出通知，就提前卖掉了一部分，结果后来看到股价继续上涨，心里真的挺后悔的。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 585,
      "start_index": 2390,
      "end_index": 2406,
      "text": "===== 资讯助理 =====",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 586,
      "start_index": 2407,
      "end_index": 2424,
      "text": "各位，今天上午的交流就先到这里啦！",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 587,
      "start_index": 2425,
      "end_index": 2486,
      "text": "感谢大家积极参与讨论！今天是本周最后一个交易日，下午我们会继续关注BET指数及主要股票的市场变化，看看上午的行情能否延续。",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 588,
      "start_index": 2487,
      "end_index": 2503,
      "text": "大家稍作休息，我们下午再见！😊",
      "tab_id": "t.gbfri5r8vs3o"
    }
